# local visual-verification output (scripts/verify-pair-visual.mjs)
/artifacts/

# Prompt 575 — ad-hoc verification scratch, never committed.
#
# ~90 of these accumulated untracked over months, and one of them
# (_lote_E_founder_cookie.txt) was a founder session cookie in plain text. A
# `git add -A scripts` staged the lot, including that file; it was caught by
# reading the staged list, which is a reflex and not a control. This is the
# control. Real, reusable scripts have no leading underscore and are unaffected.
/scripts/_*
/.scratch_pacote/
